{
  "$comment": "Palettes ported from well-known open-source colour schemes. Each is data, not a stylesheet: src/themes/index.js maps one of these onto the engine's design tokens and the panel's, so adding a theme means adding an entry here — never another CSS file. All sources are MIT licensed; attribution is carried per theme and shown in the picker.",
