    {
      "$comment": "The two house themes: one dark, one light, and the defaults. The others above are ports of existing colour schemes and stay as choices; these two are the app's own face. Data-Dense Pro is what this product already is — a terminal, a diff and an activity stream, where density is the point — so it takes the family's flat near-black, fluorescent accent, tight radius and borders-not-shadows.",
